            "review_title": "Review at Pho Bo, Ga",
            "review_text": "Mai Hương\n2 contributions\n0\nPho is very good, but the restaurant space should change\nJul 2023 • Solo\nPho Bo restaurant has delicious and appetizing food, beef is added to the food quite a lot and it is delicious, the seasoning is seasoned to my taste. The broth is quite good and the side dishes are vegetables. They have ready-made spices for everyone to choose and add themselves. However, in my opinion, this restaurant is really not very comfortable, they should change other furniture and equipment and should clean it more. Really hard to choose it to come next time.\nRead more\nWritten August 19, 2023",
