            "review_title": "Review at Pho Bo, Ga",
            "review_text": "Jack\n2 contributions\n0\nThe pho restaurant is delicious but the space should be improved\nJun 2023 • Friends\nI have a fondness for Vietnamese specialties especially pho, this restaurant is located at 32 Bat Dan Hoan Kiem, Hanoi. There are many types of pho here for you to choose from such as chicken pho, beef noodle soup, the broth of the pho is not the best but I think it's acceptable for the price. The tables and chairs used here are all plastic and everything is not cleaned, so it is quite inconvenient for us to eat here, My friend is a clean person so he does not like the restaurant here very much. . The Restaurant should change and clean things up\nRead more\nWritten August 17, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
