            "review_text": "Jermainech\nPhitsanulok, Thailand51 contributions\n0\nExcellent fried beef noodles\nNov 2018 • Friends\nWe had the beef pho and the fried beef noodles on our first try. The fried beef noodles stood out and is a clear winner. It has a amazing aroma of smokiness and the hint of a slight burnt smell (without anything actually being burnt). I returned the very next evening for the fried noodles. Best eaten with the freshly cut red chili and a generous serving of herbs that are served together on the side. The locals dipped the herbs/salads into to a small bowl of white vinegary sauce with chili before plunging them with the noodles into their mouths.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 18, 2018",
