            "review_text": "SwissGlobeTraveler\n19 contributions\n0\nNot worth it...\nMay 2018 • Solo\nI went there because of all the good reviews here on Tripadvisor. Unfortunately it was a disappointing experience.\nFirst the man working there didn't even look at me - I stood right in front of him, saying \"hello\" and he looked the other way to obviously ignore me. Then I took the menu from another foreigner eating there. I ordered my Pho and organized me a chair myself from chamber there as there were none left in the seating are. After paying 50.000 Dong, the Vietnamese behind me paid 35.000 for the same Pho. Asking the man working there about it, he just orgnored me again. Did not even look at me. As the only other not-Vietnamese there told me that it was the same for him, i get the feeling that they just have a problem with foreigners... I don't know... And i am not a person awaiting any kind of service in places like this, especially not in Hanoi, but this experience let me down... Better go to one of the restaurants where they want to serve guests, as there are lots of them in this amazing city, serving great food.\nAnyway the Pho was okay, not the best I had in Hanoi, but also not bad. Def. not worth the fight to get some.\nRead more\nWritten May 23, 2018",
